            <note corresp="#d518-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d518-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Transmits letter from Lloyd to Herter on position on nuclear test talks.
                    Secret. 8 pp. Eisenhower Library, White House Office Files, Project Clean Up,
                    State Mepco Cables.</p>
            </note>
